window.docContents[240].resolve({"/Environment-and--___/#Cvc___lean----High-Level-CVC5-API--Environment-and--___--Environment-and--___":{"contents":"\nMost types in the Cvc library take an implicit instance of the Ω class.\n\n#check Ω\n\n\n#check Env.run\n\n\nCvc.Env.run {α : Type} (code : [inst : Ω] → Env α) : BaseIO (Res α)\n\n\nvariable [Ω]\n\n\ndef codeInEnv : Env Unit :=\n  println! \"running in the cvc5 environment\"\n\n#eval Env.runIO codeInEnv\n\n\nrunning in the cvc5 environment\n\n\n","context":"Cvc.lean -- High-Level CVC5 API\u0009Environment and  Ω","header":"1.2. Environment and  Ω","id":"/Environment-and--___/#Cvc___lean----High-Level-CVC5-API--Environment-and--___--Environment-and--___"}});